COPY_FROZEN -> COPY_SOURCE: "Source upper bound may become capacity evidence only after unique scanning and destination packing are proved."
ABORT_ISOLATION -> COPY_FROZEN: "Old collective publishes abort_isolated before healthy GC; detached empty intervals may be reused, stable native identity must not be overwritten."
CHUNK_TRANSPORT -> COPY_SOURCE: "Disjoint chunk traversal requests do not replace the per-object write claim; copy-winner Tail and special frame links retain separate custody."
FRAME_ACCESS -> COPY_SOURCE: "A scanner claiming a raw-ready frame must acquire the frame domain before reading the structural link or ordinary roots; constructor writes precede release."
COPY_RESERVATION -> COPY_FROZEN: "Private grants and known-result refunds provide physical accounting premises; they do not alone establish U, Amax or a pre-flip whole-round grant."
COPY_RESERVATION -> FRAME_ACCESS: "Captured-frame payload construction uses the same contiguous reservation and commit endpoints; frame/link publication does not erase allocation debt."
STARTUP_ACTIVATION -> STARTUP_REUSE: "READY certifies Scheme initialization for one generation; successful join closes its native identity before slot overwrite."
STARTUP_ACTIVATION -> COPY_FROZEN: "A readiness waiter remains a GC participant with a complete C-FFI root origin; no native lock is held while servicing GC."
ROUND_CAPACITY -> COPY_RESERVATION: "Local cancellation is only one term of whole-round physical accounting and cannot authorize a parity flip or refund section publication."
COPY_RESERVATION -> CAS_REFUND_CONTROL: "Observed known loss uses the production reservation and cancellation functions; a scheduler control may not write the CAS result or fabricate accounting."
RESIZE_SOURCES -> COPY_FROZEN: "All source slots join the frozen VM root inventory before source-word census and copying. Root aliases do not justify duplicated copy work or a larger heap."
RESIZE_SOURCES -> STARTUP_ACTIVATION: "Selection reloads the source cell; ledger then context startup roots take responsibility before source ACK. Managed readiness starts after source transport drain and owns no source-root dependency."
RESIZE_SOURCES -> ROUND_CAPACITY: "Reserve the fixed registry outside the GC transaction and include its payload reachability in the closed source inventory. A valid root handoff cannot authorize parity flip without the separate physical layout receipt."
sysml: SysML contracts and handoffs
ascent: ASCENT artifact-qualified evidence and dependency joins
